	quest.044A826CBD999250.quest_desc: [
		"This is obtained from a chest located within the bronze dungeon after defeating the slider."
		""
		"The hammer can be used like a melee-weapon via left-clicking, however, right-clicking will perform a special function. Right-clicking \"throws\" the hammer in the direction the player is facing, but does not remove it from the player's inventory. Upon damaging a mob or player, the hammer durability is decreased by one."
		""
		"Throwing the hammer has a small area of effect (3-4 blocks) and will damage all mobs within the AoE radius. The hammer has a 10 second cooldown after right-clicking, and will inflict knockback to users and enemies when used. Enemies receive much heavier knockback, however. Hammer of Notch ignores gravity and can be repaired using an Altar"
	]
	quest.044A826CBD999250.quest_subtitle: "Obtain the hammer of Kingbdogz."
