	quest.0F9C5D39DEECCE8D.quest_desc: [
		"Blood Roses grow in snowy biomes. It was previously believed that Blood Roses collected the blood of entities that passed through them, which was found out to be false. The name for this flower was given because of that belief, but also because of the scarlet color of the petals."
		""
		"Blood Roses are used to create the Regeneration Ring."
		""
		"A famous Alchemist discovered that blood roses actually did not collect the blood of entities but only a sample of their energy."
	]
