	quest.1B8E4B3BE2D57E2F.quest_desc: [
		"This is obtained from a chest located within the gold dungeon after defeating the sun spirit."
		""
		"The Sun Altar is a block recieved after defeating the Sun Spirit. The Sun Spirit drops the Sun Altar upon death as well as the Gold Key. The Sun Altar allows the user to control the time in the Aether, with the GUI being opened by right clicking the Sun Altar after placing it. The player can slide a slider which determines the time of day, with the very far left of the bar consisting of dawn, and the very far right consisting of night. As time passes in the Aether after deafeating the Sun Spirit, the player will need to continually move the slider back into position to keep the time at the position they require."
	]
	quest.1B8E4B3BE2D57E2F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain a sun altar."
	quest.1B9A6636687E4023.quest_desc: [
		"I believe this is obtained from slaying a marauder, please let me know if otherwise - haunted."
