		"Spectres are new flying mobs that can be found in Lichen Caves. They spawn as an ambient mob. So, if you want them to be persistent, you need to collect them with a glass bottle and give them a custom name. In order to spectate them, you need to give it an allurite shard to make them \"spectatable\" and link it with a spyglass to get a spectre bound spyglass which can be used to spectate the spectre."
		"Reward: x1 spyglass"
	]
	quest.23C8E69B44A7FADC.quest_subtitle: "Collect a spectre into a bottle."
