	quest.389EE7E0B3CFB9E8.quest_subtitle: "Craft sticky honey redstone."
	quest.389F55837BB937CA.quest_desc: ["\"Spiders used to keep the Overworld in fear under the rule of the Spider Queen. The Gnomes were the most affected by it. So one day, the Gnome King decided to stop that massacre and went to challenge the Spider Queen. The battle was legendary. But the Gnome King knew that he wouldn't be able to defeat her because of how powerful she was, so he locked the Spider Queen inside of her dungeon never to be seen again until some adventurer would liberate her to get rid of her once and for all...\" - Prophecy of the Overworld Chapter 2, Page 3"]
	quest.389F55837BB937CA.quest_subtitle: "Defeat the spider queen."
	quest.38C0D2861271EFF7.quest_desc: ["Bows with improved durability and damage as well as the ability to use augments. Refer to MA guide for details."]
