	quest.3907D66EAD05B9B1.quest_desc: ["Berry Pies: They are just like a cake except they are pies! Isn't that crazy? If that didn't convince you, due to pies being superior you can easily cut them into slices as well as pick them up if you've accidentally dropped one on the floor. Be careful though when picking one up after you've eaten from it beacause it will most likely fall apart into the amount of slices you've left there."]
