	quest.6044BAC4597533FE.quest_desc: ["The Dungeon has 4 underground floor, the last one being the treasure room. Reaching the treasure room won't be easy... You'll need to find a way to get through the small tunnels as the dungeon was made by Gnomes for Gnomes. There's also some traps and secrets, so definitely come prepared."]
