	quest.6BDF5806363934DB.quest_desc: ["Plushies are found in village chests, and player plushies can be found in treasure chests and shipwrecks around the world. These blocks don’t do anything; however, try right clicking them. The hidden easter eggs are bound to put a smile on your face :)"]
