	quest.6BFCF1DADB424837.quest_desc: [
		"If there are any quests here (specifically the summoning quests) that do not work, please let me know. "
		""
		"I am very unfamiliar with this mod. Please message me in Discord if you come across errors or have suggestions, thank you. "
		""
		"&bPS: I purposefully did not include descriptions for each of these quests, as I feel we should use the Dictionary of Spirits to guide our journey through this mod. "
		""
		"So, for each quest please refer to the Dictionary of Spirits for further information. Thank you! &r"
		""
		"&aHere is the link to the Occultism CurseForge page where there is further information on the mod: https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/occultism&r"
	]
	quest.6BFCF1DADB424837.quest_subtitle: "My apologies..."
