	quest.6CCD0D33C98F9CD3.quest_desc: [
		"The Incubator can be right clicked to open its GUI. There are two slots in the Incubator GUI, the top one for Moa Eggs and the bottom one for Incubator fuel, such as Ambrosium Chunks or Irradiated Dust. There is also a bar on the right side of the GUI that will fill up when fuel and a Moa Egg are put into the Incubator slots. For the heating bar to reach the top, 4 Ambrosium Chunks are required. Once it reaches the top, the Moa Egg will finish incubating."
		""
		"If the Moa Egg is removed from the Incubator while it is incubating, the bar will drop back down to being empty. If there are not enough Ambrosium Chunks to finish incubating the egg, the Moa Egg will break."
	]
	quest.6CCD0D33C98F9CD3.quest_subtitle: "Incubate a Moa"
