	quest.7FD743BE868E7530.quest_desc: [
		"This provides you with a small wallet to organize your coins and can be placed in your wallet curio slot. Also, don't forget to set a keybind for it."
		"Reward: x5 copper coin"
	]
	quest.7FD743BE868E7530.quest_subtitle: "Craft a copper wallet."
	quest.7FDED6B1EC2EEB3E.quest_desc: [
		"This is used in the Cooking for Blockheads multi-block kitchen to create food for your belly from the ingredients you store in the other blocks."
		"Reward: x2 artichoke seeds"
	]
	quest.7FDED6B1EC2EEB3E.quest_subtitle: "Craft a cooking table."
	quest.7FE0CB9FFE4DC593.quest_desc: [
		"A fluid storage disk is an item where items from the storage system are stored on. It has to be put in a disk drive. The fluid storage disk won’t despawn when dropped in the world. Refer to RS Wiki for more info."
		"Reward: x2 quartz enriched iron"
	]
	quest.7FE0CB9FFE4DC593.quest_subtitle: "Craft a 64k fluid storage disk."
	quest.7FE952B1393A9BCE.quest_desc: ["This is done by opening the Book of Lore and on the first page is a square in which you place the second Book of Lore."]
	quest.7FE952B1393A9BCE.quest_subtitle: "Put a Book of Lore inside a Book of Lore."
	quest.7FF8B537EB62DF5D.quest_desc: ["Storage Networks can also be connected. In order to do this you need either an Inventory Cable Connector or a filtered  Inventory Cable Connector. These will let you connect you storage network with overseas locations for your storage network."]
	quest.7FF8B537EB62DF5D.quest_subtitle: "Craft a framed inventory cable."
